WEBVTT

00:00:00.718 --> 00:00:04.184
A student drags their chapter PDF into Kelus.

00:00:04.184 --> 00:00:10.898
Kelus reads the chapter and shows the topics it found, from the student's own headings.

00:00:10.898 --> 00:00:17.744
Kelus finds the topics and shows the first one's key lines to read.

00:00:17.744 --> 00:00:27.864
Quick checks written from lines in the chapter: right, and one slip shown against its line.

00:00:27.864 --> 00:00:43.210
The student explains it in their own words and compares with the page.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:48.262
The result, then the plan: the missed line comes back first tomorrow.
